# This skill is site-owned (repo-local).
# The cms-platform `skills-sync` workflow treats any skill directory containing a
# `.repo-local` file as opt-out of the platform sync: it is never overwritten or
# deleted by the platform-authoritative rsync. Without this marker the sync
# clobbered this skill on every run (see cms-platform PR #174, adamdaniel.ai#2593).